Package: com.swiftss.awemecameraenhancer
Name: Aweme Camera Enhancer
Version: 1.2.6
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Defaults Douyin 40.2.0 camera to video, extends recording duration, enables the native Live Photo recording switch, saves a metadata-matched Live Photo pair, and returns through Douyin's native edit flow.
